ty, and his decision speed is critical. Also he is 100% reliable, which is key. So maybe shift recommendation to C.\n\nWe should reference Agent 2's points and bring in our facts. Provide argument that C's reliability and crew atmosphere are strong, and his decision speed is important for long-distance flights. Acknowledge his communication difficulty but note that he creates positive atmosphere, maybe mitigates. Compare to B's interpersonal issues (grumpy, uncooperative). So propose C as leading.\n\nThus public message: I appreciate Agent 2's view, but I think Candidate C may be stronger overall. Provide evidence: 100% reliable, positive crew atmosphere, quick correct decisions. Concern: communication difficulty, egocentric, not willing to further education. But overall reliability and decision quality are top. Compare to B's grumpy/uncooperative. So I shift vote to C.\n\nWe need to output metadata vote: Candidate C.\n\nProceed."}
